{
 "schema": 1,
 "audio": {},
 "complete": {},
 "level": {
  "2": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\2_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/2_level.flac",
    "dur": 6.6,
    "cps": 15.7,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 438665828,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0003,
     "fr": 0.9995,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 15.7,
     "secs": 6.6
    },
    "text": "Un premier pas, et déjà la terre vous reconnaît. Je suis là, tout près. Vous ne m'entendrez pas souvent.",
    "text_hash": "a82e221669367cf9",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:39:57"
   }
  },
  "3": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\3_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/3_level.flac",
    "dur": 5.4,
    "cps": 16.9,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 1855637865,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0005,
     "fr": 0.999,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 16.9,
     "secs": 5.4
    },
    "text": "Écoutez le vent dans les branches. Il murmure plus bas que moi, et il vous dit de continuer.",
    "text_hash": "41fa221322820989",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:40:02"
   }
  },
  "4": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\4_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/4_level.flac",
    "dur": 5.0,
    "cps": 19.8,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 1533009717,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0004,
     "fr": 0.999,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 19.8,
     "secs": 5.0
    },
    "text": "Vos mains apprennent vite. Les miennes ont mis des siècles à savoir ce que les vôtres devinent déjà.",
    "text_hash": "5fc1cab10e85e987",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:40:06"
   }
  },
  "5": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\5_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/5_level.flac",
    "dur": 7.6,
    "cps": 14.9,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 1041387467,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0005,
     "fr": 0.999,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 14.9,
     "secs": 7.6
    },
    "text": "Le foyer est encore à portée de voix. Profitez de sa chaleur. Un jour, vous la porterez en vous, très loin d'ici.",
    "text_hash": "21a491b23f5c7be5",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:40:12"
   }
  },
  "6": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\6_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/6_level.flac",
    "dur": 6.8,
    "cps": 14.6,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 274877779,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0002,
     "fr": 0.9995,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 14.6,
     "secs": 6.8
    },
    "text": "Doucement. Rien ne presse encore. Les arbres anciens ont grandi sans hâte, et ils touchent le ciel.",
    "text_hash": "1991a82d85ab730c",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:40:17"
   }
  },
  "7": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\7_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/7_level.flac",
    "dur": 7.1,
    "cps": 17.7,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 22257386,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0003,
     "fr": 0.999,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 17.7,
     "secs": 7.1
    },
    "text": "Vous vous demandez qui je suis. C'est bien naturel. Je vous le dirai, le jour où vous aurez marché assez loin pour l'entendre.",
    "text_hash": "992d32ef18db4bdb",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:40:22"
   }
  },
  "8": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\8_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/8_level.flac",
    "dur": 7.1,
    "cps": 16.7,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 1207325573,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0003,
     "fr": 0.9995,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 16.7,
     "secs": 7.1
    },
    "text": "Ce soir, une lueur danse au-dessus des collines. Ce n'est qu'une étoile, mais j'aime croire qu'elle vous regarde aussi.",
    "text_hash": "88d22eda193b5c91",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:40:28"
   }
  },
  "9": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\9_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/9_level.flac",
    "dur": 6.1,
    "cps": 17.6,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 1630468908,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0004,
     "fr": 0.999,
     "wer": 0.048,
     "cps": 17.6,
     "secs": 6.1
    },
    "text": "Autour de vous, les gens commencent à retenir votre nom. C'est peu de chose. C'est ainsi que tout commence.",
    "text_hash": "93a315547dec8d5d",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:40:33"
   }
  },
  "10": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\10_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/10_level.flac",
    "dur": 7.4,
    "cps": 16.6,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 1020803936,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0001,
     "fr": 0.9995,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 16.6,
     "secs": 7.4
    },
    "text": "Regardez derrière vous. Le chemin du foyer paraît si court, à présent. Le monde vous attend plus loin, et je vous suivrai.",
    "text_hash": "c78a2860526cef38",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:40:39"
   }
  },
  "11": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\11_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/11_level.flac",
    "dur": 7.2,
    "cps": 18.3,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 609359439,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0007,
     "fr": 0.9985,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 18.3,
     "secs": 7.2
    },
    "text": "Les routes s'ouvrent. Elles sont vieilles, bien plus que les royaumes qu'elles relient. Elles ont vu passer des rois et des fuyards.",
    "text_hash": "0cf82fbce2665aba",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:40:45"
   }
  },
  "12": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\12_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/12_level.flac",
    "dur": 4.4,
    "cps": 18.2,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 1094620488,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0012,
     "fr": 0.9966,
     "wer": 0.053,
     "cps": 18.2,
     "secs": 4.4
    },
    "text": "Je m'appelle Elise. Il y a longtemps que je n'avais plus dit ce nom à quelqu'un.",
    "text_hash": "c77b189b1ff22e90",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:40:49"
   }
  },
  "13": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\13_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/13_level.flac",
    "dur": 6.5,
    "cps": 16.2,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 300401015,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0003,
     "fr": 0.999,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 16.2,
     "secs": 6.5
    },
    "text": "Méfiez-vous des chemins trop calmes. La Horde rôde aux marges de nos terres, et elle connaît la patience.",
    "text_hash": "f5cc242c5cca345f",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:40:53"
   }
  },
  "14": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\14_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/14_level.flac",
    "dur": 5.4,
    "cps": 16.2,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 1763748554,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0005,
     "fr": 0.9985,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 16.2,
     "secs": 5.4
    },
    "text": "Il pleut. J'aime ce bruit sur les feuilles. Il me rappelle une forêt qui n'existe plus.",
    "text_hash": "368e4f00b691eae6",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:40:57"
   }
  },
  "15": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\15_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/15_level.flac",
    "dur": 6.5,
    "cps": 16.4,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 1159396318,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0005,
     "fr": 0.999,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 16.4,
     "secs": 6.5
    },
    "text": "Par-delà la mer, il y a Kalimdor, la terre de mon peuple. Les Royaumes de l'Est sont jeunes à côté d'elle.",
    "text_hash": "9f928b2e287f0cd6",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:41:01"
   }
  },
  "16": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\16_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/16_level.flac",
    "dur": 5.6,
    "cps": 15.7,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 327657758,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0006,
     "fr": 0.9985,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 15.7,
     "secs": 5.6
    },
    "text": "Votre pas est plus sûr qu'hier. Votre regard aussi. C'est le regard qui trompe le moins.",
    "text_hash": "0c0550ffaf229df5",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:41:05"
   }
  },
  "17": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\17_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/17_level.flac",
    "dur": 6.4,
    "cps": 17.5,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 885785167,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0003,
     "fr": 0.999,
     "wer": 0.05,
     "cps": 17.5,
     "secs": 6.4
    },
    "text": "Combien de royaumes ai-je vus naître et tomber ? Celui que vous bâtissez en marchant ne ressemble à aucun autre.",
    "text_hash": "1bda96fa11653288",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:41:10"
   }
  },
  "18": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\18_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/18_level.flac",
    "dur": 6.2,
    "cps": 18.0,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 1730927189,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0003,
     "fr": 0.9995,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 18.0,
     "secs": 6.2
    },
    "text": "Une ruine, au bord du chemin. Ne passez pas trop vite. Les pierres se souviennent de ceux qui les ont oubliées.",
    "text_hash": "9dc13d5e1c048e42",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:41:14"
   }
  },
  "19": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\19_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/19_level.flac",
    "dur": 8.0,
    "cps": 14.5,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 1217473544,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0001,
     "fr": 1.0,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 14.5,
     "secs": 8.0
    },
    "text": "Parfois, la nuit, je sens quelque chose remuer très loin au sud. Un vieux sommeil qui s'agite. Ce n'est rien encore.",
    "text_hash": "bd576bc40e597742",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:41:21"
   }
  },
  "20": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\20_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/20_level.flac",
    "dur": 8.0,
    "cps": 17.1,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 1040235423,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0004,
     "fr": 0.999,
     "wer": 0.074,
     "cps": 17.1,
     "secs": 8.0
    },
    "text": "Jadis, je veillais sous la lumière d'Elune, parmi les sentinelles de mon peuple. Ce que j'ai gardé alors, je vous le confierai peu à peu.",
    "text_hash": "c0b2ce1e092f2652",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:41:26"
   }
  },
  "21": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\21_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/21_level.flac",
    "dur": 6.5,
    "cps": 15.1,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 290960061,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0008,
     "fr": 0.9985,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 15.1,
     "secs": 6.5
    },
    "text": "Marais, collines, cols enneigés. Le monde est plus vaste qu'on ne le croit, et plus ancien encore.",
    "text_hash": "4cc513b16cc5a134",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:41:30"
   }
  },
  "22": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\22_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/22_level.flac",
    "dur": 6.4,
    "cps": 16.9,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 1343801793,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0002,
     "fr": 0.9995,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 16.9,
     "secs": 6.4
    },
    "text": "Respirez. Vous avez le droit de vous arrêter un instant. Même les sentinelles ferment les yeux, quelquefois.",
    "text_hash": "f49372ea48934ae3",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:41:34"
   }
  },
  "23": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\23_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/23_level.flac",
    "dur": 6.1,
    "cps": 17.8,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 1064967855,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0003,
     "fr": 0.999,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 17.8,
     "secs": 6.1
    },
    "text": "Dans mon peuple, on dit qu'une âme se mesure aux promesses qu'elle tient. Vous tenez les vôtres. Je le vois.",
    "text_hash": "b78ee24a0b97dc63",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:41:38"
   }
  },
  "25": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\25_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/25_level.flac",
    "dur": 7.0,
    "cps": 16.5,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 1954276981,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0003,
     "fr": 0.9995,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 16.5,
     "secs": 7.0
    },
    "text": "Quand j'étais jeune, le monde n'avait qu'un seul continent. Puis le Puits d'éternité a sombré, et tout s'est brisé.",
    "text_hash": "dc72ac62ee54d45f",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:41:47"
   }
  },
  "26": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\26_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/26_level.flac",
    "dur": 7.4,
    "cps": 18.5,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 1641475345,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0004,
     "fr": 0.999,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 18.5,
     "secs": 7.4
    },
    "text": "Près d'un feu de camp, des inconnus partagent leur pain avec vous. Ce sont ces soirs qui font tenir l'Alliance, bien plus que les traités.",
    "text_hash": "6378f306b78da619",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:41:52"
   }
  },
  "27": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\27_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/27_level.flac",
    "dur": 5.9,
    "cps": 15.7,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 1759986893,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0003,
     "fr": 0.9995,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 15.7,
     "secs": 5.9
    },
    "text": "Des cicatrices, déjà. Ne les cachez pas. Ce sont des souvenirs que le corps refuse de perdre.",
    "text_hash": "67ff27b2c3911f4f",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:41:57"
   }
  },
  "28": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\28_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/28_level.flac",
    "dur": 7.7,
    "cps": 15.4,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 901630945,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0002,
     "fr": 0.9995,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 15.4,
     "secs": 7.7
    },
    "text": "Au sud, sous le sable, se dresse un mur que mon peuple a levé contre l'ombre. J'étais là, le jour où il s'est refermé.",
    "text_hash": "78bcce072f453a00",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:42:03"
   }
  },
  "29": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\29_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/29_level.flac",
    "dur": 6.2,
    "cps": 14.8,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 506186530,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0005,
     "fr": 0.999,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 14.8,
     "secs": 6.2
    },
    "text": "Tant de ruines sur votre chemin. Chacune était un foyer, autrefois. Marchez-y avec respect.",
    "text_hash": "2b7381dd920dda4d",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:42:08"
   }
  },
  "30": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\30_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/30_level.flac",
    "dur": 8.3,
    "cps": 17.8,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 279912730,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0003,
     "fr": 0.9995,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 17.8,
     "secs": 8.3
    },
    "text": "Savez-vous pourquoi je marche à vos côtés ? Parce que le mur faiblit, et qu'il faudra quelqu'un pour se tenir devant lui. Je crois que ce sera vous.",
    "text_hash": "ad90bc944ca954b1",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:42:15"
   }
  },
  "31": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\31_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/31_level.flac",
    "dur": 7.4,
    "cps": 17.0,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 65915751,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0003,
     "fr": 0.999,
     "wer": 0.083,
     "cps": 17.0,
     "secs": 7.4
    },
    "text": "Du nord monte un froid étrange. Les morts y marchent sous la bannière du Fléau, et les terres qu'il touche ne guérissent pas.",
    "text_hash": "8355e602f2a3c6db",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:42:21"
   }
  },
  "32": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\32_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/32_level.flac",
    "dur": 5.6,
    "cps": 16.1,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 2128970633,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0004,
     "fr": 0.999,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 16.1,
     "secs": 5.6
    },
    "text": "Pas un mot ce soir. Juste ma présence, tout près, pendant que vous reprenez votre souffle.",
    "text_hash": "fb7859a703633ca5",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:42:26"
   }
  },
  "33": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\33_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/33_level.flac",
    "dur": 8.3,
    "cps": 15.0,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 161338028,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0003,
     "fr": 0.9995,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 15.0,
     "secs": 8.3
    },
    "text": "Chez les humains, on nomme cela du courage. Mon peuple disait plutôt fidélité, fidélité à ce qu'on aime, quoi qu'il en coûte.",
    "text_hash": "5b69260bae54f7fb",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:42:32"
   }
  },
  "34": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\34_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/34_level.flac",
    "dur": 6.5,
    "cps": 16.5,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 821433301,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0007,
     "fr": 0.9985,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 16.5,
     "secs": 6.5
    },
    "text": "Sur les crêtes, des ailes noires passent dans la fumée. Les dragons ne sont jamais partis. Ils attendaient.",
    "text_hash": "3707bd26437c20a9",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:42:37"
   }
  },
  "35": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\35_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/35_level.flac",
    "dur": 5.4,
    "cps": 16.4,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 1732797670,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0003,
     "fr": 0.9995,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 16.4,
     "secs": 5.4
    },
    "text": "Celui que j'aimais est tombé au pied du mur. Je n'en avais jamais parlé. Pas avant vous.",
    "text_hash": "c1fda629f209071a",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:42:42"
   }
  },
  "36": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\36_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/36_level.flac",
    "dur": 6.2,
    "cps": 20.5,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 7651875,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0002,
     "fr": 0.9995,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 20.5,
     "secs": 6.2
    },
    "text": "On parle de vous dans les tavernes, maintenant. Laissez dire. Ce qui compte, c'est ce que vous faites quand personne ne regarde.",
    "text_hash": "ae0a9b89c2c1a99d",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:42:47"
   }
  },
  "37": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\37_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/37_level.flac",
    "dur": 7.7,
    "cps": 16.3,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 855084351,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0005,
     "fr": 0.999,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 16.3,
     "secs": 7.7
    },
    "text": "Sous la terre dorment des choses plus vieilles que les elfes. Les dieux anciens rêvent, et leurs rêves empoisonnent le monde.",
    "text_hash": "c63476be4ee42645",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:42:53"
   }
  },
  "38": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\38_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/38_level.flac",
    "dur": 5.8,
    "cps": 17.6,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 1069849832,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0001,
     "fr": 0.9995,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 17.6,
     "secs": 5.8
    },
    "text": "Ma voix vous semble plus proche. C'est vrai. Plus vous avancez, plus il m'est facile de vous rejoindre.",
    "text_hash": "0d2cec7b97c7f8f2",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:42:58"
   }
  },
  "39": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\39_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/39_level.flac",
    "dur": 6.1,
    "cps": 15.6,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 1489148268,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0004,
     "fr": 0.999,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 15.6,
     "secs": 6.1
    },
    "text": "Depuis quelques jours, le vent du sud porte du sable jusqu'ici. Je n'aime pas ce qu'il murmure.",
    "text_hash": "d874285d781a8efd",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:43:03"
   }
  },
  "40": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\40_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/40_level.flac",
    "dur": 9.8,
    "cps": 17.0,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 1434717934,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0006,
     "fr": 0.9985,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 17.0,
     "secs": 9.8
    },
    "text": "Quelque chose a changé en vous. Les bêtes s'écartent, les sentinelles vous saluent. Mais c'est votre douceur que je remarque, restée intacte malgré tout le sang versé.",
    "text_hash": "316ea29434a1492f",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:43:09"
   }
  },
  "41": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\41_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/41_level.flac",
    "dur": 9.2,
    "cps": 15.0,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 1133161735,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0006,
     "fr": 0.999,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 15.0,
     "secs": 9.2
    },
    "text": "Derrière le mur, une cité d'insectes attend, et sous elle, un dieu qui n'a pas de visage. Mon peuple l'a enfermé. Il ne l'a jamais vaincu.",
    "text_hash": "a684dd8b18d08501",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:43:15"
   }
  },
  "42": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\42_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/42_level.flac",
    "dur": 5.6,
    "cps": 18.9,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 1859826964,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0005,
     "fr": 0.9985,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 18.9,
     "secs": 5.6
    },
    "text": "Ne cherchez pas à tout porter. Les charges les plus lourdes se partagent entre ceux qui marchent ensemble.",
    "text_hash": "6230d23b1220ceaa",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:43:20"
   }
  },
  "43": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\43_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/43_level.flac",
    "dur": 7.6,
    "cps": 16.2,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 1938558203,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0002,
     "fr": 0.9995,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 16.2,
     "secs": 7.6
    },
    "text": "Là où le Fléau est passé, l'herbe ne repousse pas. Pourtant, vous y avez allumé une lumière. Les vivants s'en souviendront.",
    "text_hash": "7956db6acbd3e897",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:43:41"
   }
  },
  "45": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\45_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/45_level.flac",
    "dur": 8.7,
    "cps": 15.3,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 8624046,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0011,
     "fr": 0.9976,
     "wer": 0.08,
     "cps": 15.3,
     "secs": 8.7
    },
    "text": "Tout au fond du Mont Blackrock, un feu ancien gronde. Des nains l'ont appelé jadis, par orgueil, et le monde paie encore leur erreur.",
    "text_hash": "d01fb800592a85d9",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:43:52"
   }
  },
  "46": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\46_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/46_level.flac",
    "dur": 7.4,
    "cps": 17.0,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 918443732,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0003,
     "fr": 0.9995,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 17.0,
     "secs": 7.4
    },
    "text": "Moi, je ne vous protège pas. Je n'en ai pas le pouvoir. Je marche seulement à vos côtés, et c'est vous qui me rendez courage.",
    "text_hash": "2fc9c165dfb870c7",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:43:58"
   }
  },
  "47": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\47_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/47_level.flac",
    "dur": 9.5,
    "cps": 15.1,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 409755821,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0006,
     "fr": 0.999,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 15.1,
     "secs": 9.5
    },
    "text": "Elle se fait appeler dame, à la cour des hommes. Sous ce sourire, c'est Onyxia, fille du dragon noir, et elle tire les fils d'un royaume entier.",
    "text_hash": "1394fecacc5a9274",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:44:05"
   }
  },
  "48": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\48_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/48_level.flac",
    "dur": 6.8,
    "cps": 15.6,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 213235661,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0002,
     "fr": 0.9995,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 15.6,
     "secs": 6.8
    },
    "text": "Fermez les yeux un instant. Entendez-vous la forêt qui respire ? Elle respire pour vous aussi, maintenant.",
    "text_hash": "a9287a9b19e2d55f",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:44:11"
   }
  },
  "49": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\49_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/49_level.flac",
    "dur": 10.0,
    "cps": 15.5,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 990452888,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0007,
     "fr": 0.9985,
     "wer": 0.034,
     "cps": 15.5,
     "secs": 10.0
    },
    "text": "Son frère, Nefarian, veille au sommet de la montagne de feu. Il façonne des créatures avec le sang de tous les dragons. Ce qu'il prépare dépasse la guerre.",
    "text_hash": "6fcabad473a908cc",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:44:18"
   }
  },
  "50": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\50_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/50_level.flac",
    "dur": 12.0,
    "cps": 15.4,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 963667455,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0005,
     "fr": 0.999,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 15.4,
     "secs": 12.0
    },
    "text": "À présent, je peux vous le dire. Le jour où le mur s'est refermé, j'ai juré d'attendre quelqu'un capable de le regarder sans trembler. J'ai attendu mille ans. Puis vos pas sont arrivés.",
    "text_hash": "815c11c4a8de9e88",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:44:31"
   }
  },
  "51": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\51_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/51_level.flac",
    "dur": 6.8,
    "cps": 17.9,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 1741077072,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0007,
     "fr": 0.9985,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 17.9,
     "secs": 6.8
    },
    "text": "Mon peuple se méfie de presque tout le monde. Pourtant, les plus anciennes de mes sœurs prononcent votre nom avec respect.",
    "text_hash": "a8f5b49ee55fe49e",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:44:36"
   }
  },
  "52": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\52_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/52_level.flac",
    "dur": 9.8,
    "cps": 16.4,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 1759741277,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0011,
     "fr": 0.998,
     "wer": 0.069,
     "cps": 16.4,
     "secs": 9.8
    },
    "text": "Kel'Thuzad a trahi les vivants pour servir le Fléau. Aujourd'hui, il règne sur Naxxramas, une citadelle qui flotte dans le ciel du nord comme une plaie ouverte.",
    "text_hash": "a16b341863bdadde",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:44:43"
   }
  },
  "53": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\53_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/53_level.flac",
    "dur": 7.5,
    "cps": 18.9,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 1002761171,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0002,
     "fr": 0.9995,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 18.9,
     "secs": 7.5
    },
    "text": "Plus rien ne vous fait reculer, je crois. La peur est toujours là, mais elle ne commande plus. C'est la seule victoire qui ne s'efface jamais.",
    "text_hash": "8e3f0a2b58d8b143",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:44:49"
   }
  },
  "54": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\54_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/54_level.flac",
    "dur": 9.3,
    "cps": 15.9,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 89575262,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0005,
     "fr": 0.999,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 15.9,
     "secs": 9.3
    },
    "text": "Aucune de ces ombres ne tombera sous une seule lame. Il faudra des compagnons, des amis, des inconnus devenus frères d'armes. Vous savez les réunir.",
    "text_hash": "3167a33df8bf1fe7",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:44:55"
   }
  },
  "55": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\55_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/55_level.flac",
    "dur": 10.0,
    "cps": 13.2,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 387219383,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0002,
     "fr": 0.999,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 13.2,
     "secs": 10.0
    },
    "text": "Ragnaros. Le Seigneur du feu, prisonnier sous la montagne, rêve de brûler Azeroth entière. Un jour, il faudra descendre jusqu'à lui.",
    "text_hash": "3161c348a39b4e54",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:45:06"
   }
  },
  "56": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\56_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/56_level.flac",
    "dur": 6.5,
    "cps": 18.4,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 1002685903,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0002,
     "fr": 0.9995,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 18.4,
     "secs": 6.5
    },
    "text": "Mes nuits sont plus calmes depuis que je vous suis. Pour la première fois depuis des siècles, je ne rêve plus du sable.",
    "text_hash": "84c3a2feb87ab190",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:45:12"
   }
  },
  "57": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\57_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/57_level.flac",
    "dur": 9.8,
    "cps": 17.0,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 31556980,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0005,
     "fr": 0.999,
     "wer": 0.065,
     "cps": 17.0,
     "secs": 9.8
    },
    "text": "Bientôt, quelqu'un frappera le gong avec le sceptre des sables, et les portes d'Ahn'Qiraj s'ouvriront. Ce jour-là, je voudrais que vous soyez parmi ceux qui entreront.",
    "text_hash": "a1129e34ceb7fe22",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:45:19"
   }
  },
  "58": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\58_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/58_level.flac",
    "dur": 8.1,
    "cps": 15.7,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 1082456852,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0007,
     "fr": 0.9985,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 15.7,
     "secs": 8.1
    },
    "text": "Souvenez-vous du foyer, de la première route, du premier feu partagé. Tout cela marche avec vous. C'est votre véritable armure.",
    "text_hash": "9c29614df4d83e8a",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:45:25"
   }
  },
  "59": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\59_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/59_level.flac",
    "dur": 7.6,
    "cps": 15.9,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 1668059876,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0007,
     "fr": 0.999,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 15.9,
     "secs": 7.6
    },
    "text": "Encore un souffle, et l'horizon change. Je sens le monde retenir son haleine autour de vous, comme la forêt avant l'aube.",
    "text_hash": "7b8adfaea9051b44",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:45:31"
   }
  },
  "60": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\60_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/60_level.flac",
    "dur": 25.0,
    "cps": 15.5,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 1810683712,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0008,
     "fr": 0.998,
     "wer": 0.039,
     "cps": 15.5,
     "secs": 25.0
    },
    "text": "Nous y sommes. Au pied du mur, autrefois, j'ai promis d'attendre. Vos pas ont tenu cette promesse à ma place, et je n'ai plus peur de ce qui revient.\n\nLe feu de Ragnaros, les ailes d'Onyxia et de Nefarian, le dieu caché d'Ahn'Qiraj, l'ombre froide de Naxxramas. Tout cela vous attend, vous et ceux qui choisiront de vous suivre. Le vrai voyage commence maintenant, et je marche avec vous.",
    "text_hash": "4fa469ce6476898b",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:45:41"
   }
  },
  "24": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\24_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/24_level.flac",
    "dur": 7.0,
    "cps": 16.7,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 1016108639,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0012,
     "fr": 0.9966,
     "wer": 0.095,
     "cps": 16.7,
     "secs": 7.0
    },
    "text": "Ces terres sauvages n'appartiennent à personne. Ni à l'Alliance, ni à la Horde. Elles appartiennent à ce qui survit.",
    "text_hash": "1c8490ed1ad5536c",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:47:30"
   }
  },
  "44": {
   "npc": 1000000,
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\1000000\\44_level.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/@elise/levels/1000000/44_level.flac",
    "dur": 8.8,
    "cps": 15.0,
    "model": "eleven_v4",
    "engine": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc",
    "seed": 1126396529,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0002,
     "fr": 0.9995,
     "wer": 0.143,
     "cps": 15.0,
     "secs": 8.8
    },
    "text": "Elune ne parle jamais fort. Elle éclaire, simplement, sans rien demander. Ces derniers soirs, sa lumière s'attarde sur votre chemin.",
    "text_hash": "2f45701d1d325def",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "G6INpmIspgFpsST79Psc"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:49:20"
   }
  }
 }
}
